# examples.md

## Purpose

This file stores approved examples of Revtek communication.

Examples should be treated as style references, not facts to copy into unrelated content.

## Product Example

> Carbon-fiber components selected to complement the vehicle's original design language, with the focus on proportion, detail, and fitment.

## Project Example

> A complete exterior transformation built around a clear design direction — from the body components to the final carbon details.

## Technical Example

> Fitment is part of the project, not an afterthought. Every component should be evaluated against the vehicle and the installation requirements before completion.

## Premium Example

> Refined where it matters. Distinctive without losing the character of the car.

## Commercial Example

> Now available for [VEHICLE / PRODUCT]. Contact Revtek for current availability, pricing, and installation options.

## Short Caption Example

> Built with intent.
> Designed around the car, not simply added to it.

## CTA Examples

### Soft CTA

> Explore the full project.

### Product CTA

> Contact Revtek for product details and current availability.

### Project CTA

> Enquire about your own build.

### Installation CTA

> Ask us about fitment and installation for your vehicle.

## Important

These examples demonstrate tone and structure.

They do not establish:

* Product availability
* Pricing
* Technical specifications
* Vehicle compatibility
* Installation capability
* Customer results

Those must come from the relevant source.
